llion of Free Cash Flow even as activity increased across our oil-weighted basins. Our assets are self-funding their own grow…", "a": "stated Nick O’Grady, Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000110448526000047/exhibit991-2026qx3earnings.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-06", "n": 2.36, "z": -0.11, "rz": 0.15, "earn": true, "q": "The strength of the NOG model shows most clearly when the macro backdrop is at its most volatile, and the flexibility of our diversified, non-operated business model is precisely what carried us through this quarter. Adjusted EBITDA was up 17% sequentially over the first quarter and we reiterated our full year producti…", "a": "commented Nick O’Grady, Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000110448526000030/exhibit991-2026qx2earnings.htm"}, {"d": "2026-04-28", "n": 1.16, "z": -0.46, "rz": -2.96, "earn": true, "q": "The current geopolitical environment is creating a dynamic environment for our business, and NOG is well-positioned to navigate it. We are seeing improved field level price realizations — particularly in the Williston — while strong hedging keeps us insulated from the seasonal weakness in natural gas prices. It is the …", "a": "commented Nick O’Grady, Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000110448526000017/exhibit991-2026qx1earnings.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-25", "n": 2.04, "z": -0.04, "rz": -2.38, "earn": true, "q": "Despite a challenging commodity price environment, NOG delivered growth in Adjusted EBITDA and production while further strengthening our balance sheet,", "a": "said Nick O’Grady, Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000110448526000005/exhibit991-earningsrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2025-12-08", "n": 4.26, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "NOG is singularly focused on executing transactions that add value to our platform for the long-term. We are extremely pleased to be partnering with Infinity on one of the last growth assets in the core of the Utica. The vertical integration of this asset adds an incremental dimension of value creation for shareholders…", "a": "commented Nick O’Grady, NOG’s Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000119312525310561/d761259dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-06", "n": 3.41, "z": 0.5, "rz": -1.9, "earn": true, "q": "Our portfolio and strategy remain resilient amid volatile market conditions. NOG is well positioned to navigate such markets to find opportunities for our investors. We seek and evaluate value-creating, accretive transactions that can position NOG for countercyclical upside convexity for the long-term. At the same time…", "a": "commented Nick O’Grady, NOG’s Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1104485/000110448525000156/exhibit991-2025qx3earnings.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-05", "z": -1.27, "mood": "down"}, "say_do": {"mood": "down", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 49, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}, {"it": "6 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "6 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earn